# Weekly backup archives written by scripts/weekly_backup.sh. Untracked *and* ignored:
# they are large, they are regenerated, and leaving them merely untracked means they show
# up in every `git status` and can be swept into a commit by an over-broad `git add`.
.backups/
# Strategy export archives produced by user_data/export_strategies.py — NEVER commit
# (they may contain sanitized configs, strategy code and backtest results)
